  "Freeform handwritten list, \"xN\" counts expanded in list order. Player name cut off at top of fax: only \"...Lightside\" is visible in a corner box; same handwriting and box layout as page 17 (\"Matt Sokol / Dark side\"), so probably Matt Sokol's Light Side deck — not confirmed.",
  "Page starts with 5 shields (Battle Plan ... A Tragedy Has Occurred); any further shields are not on this page.",
  "Between the shields and the deck list a separate group is written: \"Ralltiir, Tatooine, Kessel, Coruscant, Chandrila, Endor\" — not counted as deck lines (Chandrila and Ralltiir also appear in the main list; probably a note of systems). Main list as recorded = 59.",
